<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Voiid mark. Rebuilt from the supplied SVG, whose back bar was a 1600x1600 embedded PNG
  (5.3 MB of a 7.3 MB file). That bar is SHADED, not flat: sampled along its axis it runs
  #457512 at the ends to #AAD91E mid-bar, which is what makes it read as a stroke passing
  BEHIND the other two. Flattening it to #C6FF00 lost that depth, so it is a real gradient
  here — same shading, ~2 KB, and it scales cleanly.

  Rotations are BAKED IN: Android vector <path> has no transform attribute.
-->
